{"attack":"对自己周围的所有宝可梦进行攻击，但使出后，自己会陷入濒死。在薄雾场地上，招式威力会提高。","description":"自身陷入濒死状态，并攻击除自身外场上所有能攻击到的宝可梦。\n在薄雾场地上，若使用者为地面上的宝可梦，招式威力进一步提升50%。\n气势头带、气势披带、结实特性不能阻止使用者陷入濒死状态。\n即使招式未命中、被守住状态阻挡，或因为属性相性而没有产生效果，使用者仍然会陷入濒死状态。\n有湿气特性的宝可梦在场时，招式使用失败，且使用者不会陷入濒死状态。","levelUpMoves":[],"tutorMoves":["Clefairy","Clefable","Jigglypuff","Wigglytuff","Weezing form:galarian","Mew","Marill","Azumarill","Gardevoir","Musharna","Spritzee","Aromatisse","Swirlix","Slurpuff","Sylveon","Carbink","Xerneas form:neutral","Xerneas form:active","Diancie","Primarina","Magearna","Magearna form:original_color","Hatterene","Alcremie"],"eggMoves":[],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":[],"tmMoves9":["Clefairy","Clefable","Jigglypuff","Wigglytuff","Weezing form:galarian","Mew","Marill","Azumarill","Gardevoir","Florges","Sylveon","Carbink","Diancie","Primarina","Hatterene","Alcremie","ScreamTail"],"tmMoves8":[],"tmMoves7":[],"tmMoves6":[],"tmMoves5":[],"tmMoves4":[],"tmMoves3":[],"tmMoves2":[],"tmMoves1":[],"tmMoves":[]}